n        <h2>18 Jul 2026</h2>\n\n                    <ul class=\"h-row__film-info\">\n                                    <li>Directed by Marcela Rincón</li>\n                                    <li>Voice cast includes María Sofía Montoya Solera, Antoine Philippart Marín and  Leonor González Mina</li>\n                                    <li>76 mins</li>\n                            </ul>\n            </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Book and Trailer Buttons -->\n<section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <ul class=\"c-cinema-book\">\n                            <li><a data-fresco-group=\"trailer\" data-fresco-caption=\"\" class=\"fresco c-btn c-btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/36pL6oL0SUU\">View Trailer</a></li>\n            \n                            <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/lilas-book/book/863049\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary c-btn--book-film \">\n                        Book Now                    </a>\n                </li>\n                    </ul>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Introduction -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-col-txt\">\n                <p><strong><em>Lila&#8217;s Book</em> screens as part of the<a title=\"https://www.thelondoncolombianfilmfestival.com/\" href=\"https://www.thelondoncolombianfilmfestival.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.thelondoncolombianfilmfestival.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1779545542185000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1r8hzl8A6vav-tD1UhjBwR\"> London Colombian Film Festival</a></strong></p>\n<p>In this charming Colombian children&#8217;s animation, Lila, a character in a children&#8217;s story book, suddenly falls out of her paper world and ends up trapped in a place where she doesn&#8217;t belong&#8230; And so starts this great adventure, where Lila discovers that the only person who can save her is Ramon, the owner of the book who used to read her many years ago&#8230;</p>\n<p>But it&#8217;s not going to be easy – Ramon is no longer the little boy he once was. He has grown up and has not only stopped reading, but he&#8217;s also stopped believing in fantasy. Lila and her new friend Manuela set out to convince him of what&#8217;s happening and together they face a dangerous journey to Oblivion, to retrieve Lila&#8217;s lost book. In this adventure through magical worlds, children will explore and discover the true value of friendship and the power of fantasy.</p>\n<p><i>Welcome to the first edition of the London Colombian Film Festival 2026, where we proudly present the celebration of the </i><i>“Diversity of Voices&#8221;.</i><i> Our core objective is to showcase uncommon, vital cinematographic narratives that move far beyond the predictable headlines of violence and drugs. By turning the global spotlight onto the magic, deep resilience, immense talent, and creative dreams at the heart of our culture, we reveal a nuanced portrait of contemporary identity.</i></p>\n<p>Explore the full schedule and book your tickets now:</p>\n<p>Website: <a id=\"m_-7648527928202280328OWAa96c9c1b-1f89-fece-5cad-cefdec8e5fec\" title=\"http://www.thelondoncolombianfilmfestival.com\" href=\"http://www.thelondoncolombianfilmfestival.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.thelondoncolombianfilmfestival.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1780677259631000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YFR6qHu2w-Tsy3TdLOWf_\">www.<wbr />thelondoncolombianfilmfestival<wbr />.com</a></p>\n<p>Instagram: @theldncolfilmfest</p>\n<p><a id=\"m_-7648527928202280328OWAeb05adb3-fc7c-9dd8-2d5d-58e27c198771\" title=\"https://www.thelondoncolombianfilmfestival.com/\" href=\"https://www.thelondoncolombianfilmfestival.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.thelondoncolombianfilmfestival.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1780677259631000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3is9vZ8xFuBEqs6fL5HmuT\"><u>The London Colombian Film Festival</u></a> is organised by<a id=\"m_-7648527928202280328OWA3fc386e7-4580-fb79-fcae-87627be82a46\" title=\"http://colfilms.uk/\" href=\"http://colfilms.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://colfilms.uk/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1780677259631000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0OkFfuPDuQXZ_-KoRTNHlm\"><u> </u></a><a id=\"m_-7648527928202280328OWA3fc386e7-4580-fb79-fcae-87627be82a46\" title=\"http://colfilms.uk/\" href=\"http://colfilms.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://colfilms.uk/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1780677259631000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0OkFfuPDuQXZ_-KoRTNHlm\"><u>COL FILMS LIMITED.</u></a></p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n<!-- Construkt -->\n\n<!-- Films -->\n    </main> <!-- close global-wrap -->\n\n    <section class=\"c-footer__newsletter-form\">\n    <div class=\"o-max o-max--1400\">\n        <div class=\"o-layout o-layout--large\">\n            <div class=\"o-layout__item u-1/1@tablet\" id=\"sign-up-form\">\n                <form accept-charset=\"UTF-8\" id=\"spextrix-signup-form\">\n    <div class=\"c-newsletter-form\">\n        <h4 class=\"c-newsletter-form__title u-margin-bottom-none\">Newsletter Sign Up</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"c-newsletter-form__signup-container\">\n            <div class=\"c-newsletter-form__description\">\n                <p class=\"c-smallprint\">Sign up to receive updates from us.</p>\n                <p class=\"c-smallprint\">Your privacy is important to us. Please <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/privacy-policy/\">click here</a> to read our Privacy Policy.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div class=\"c-newsletter__signup\">\n\n                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"_wpnonce\" name=\