e-alt\" data-os-animation=\"fadeIn\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"global-header__rhs\">\n                <div class=\"global-header__menu-button\">\n            <div class=\"hamburger\">\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"global-header__button-text active\">Menu</p>\n            <p class=\"global-header__button-text\">Close</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"global-header__navigation\">\n                            <ul id=\"menu-main-menu-primary-navigation\" class=\"o-nav global-header__nav global-header__nav--primary\"><li id=\"menu-item-21228\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-21228\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/\">What’s On</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-23586\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-23586\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/cinema-listings/\">Cinema Listings</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-608\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-608\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/give/\">Give</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1946\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1946\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/creative-engagement/\">Creative Engagement</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-35321\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-35321\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/hire/\">Hires</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-23505\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-23505\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/kiln-card/\">Kiln Card</a></li>\n</ul>            \n                            <ul id=\"menu-main-menu-secondary-nav\" class=\"o-nav global-header__nav global-header__nav--secondary\"><li id=\"menu-item-21712\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-21712\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/your-visit/\">Your Visit</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-14318\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-14318\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/your-visit/access/\">Access</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-21931\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-21931\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/how-to-get-here/food-and-drink/\">Food and Drink</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-41535\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-41535\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/\">Our story</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-41539\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-41539\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/jobs/\">Job Opportunities</a></li>\n</ul>            \n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n    <!--[if lte IE 8]>\n<style>\n    body > * {\n        display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    body .no-support {\n        display: block !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<article class=\"no-support\">\n    <h4>Unfortunately the Kiln Theatre website is not accessible via the browser you're currently using.</h4>\n    <p>We recommend <a href=\"http://www.whatbrowser.org/intl/en_uk/\">upgrading your browser</a>.</p>\n</article>\n<![endif]-->\n    <main class=\"global-wrap\">\n<section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--title-bar u-red-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Now Showing</h3>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Masthead -->\n<section class=\"masthead pg__masthead pg__masthead--cinema-image c-box-gradient\" style=\"background-image: url('https://assets.kilntheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Babymother-2.png?resize=1990%2C796&gravity');\">\n    <div class=\"h-row h-row--film\">\n        <h1 class=\"pg__title\">Babymother</h1>\n        <h2>13 Aug 2026</h2>\n\n                    <ul class=\"h-row__film-info\">\n                                    <li>Directed by Julian Henriques </li>\n                                    <li>Starring Anjela Lauren Smith, Caroline Chikezie, Don Warrington and Vas Blackwood</li>\n                                    <li>82 mins</li>\n                            </ul>\n            </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Book and Trailer Buttons -->\n<section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <ul class=\"c-cinema-book\">\n                            <li><a data-fresco-group=\"trailer\" data-fresco-caption=\"\" class=\"fresco c-btn c-btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8TWBkaizImE\">View Trailer</a></li>\n            \n                            <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/babymother/book/872849\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary c-btn--book-film \">\n                        Book Now                    </a>\n                </li>\n                    </ul>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Introduction -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-col-txt\">\n                <p><strong>As part of the Kilburn High Road Festival, we are delighted to be joined by lead actor Anjela Lauren Smith for a Q&amp;A following the screening.</strong></p>\n<p>A modern Black British classic recently restored, <i>Babymother</i> follows Anita (Anjela Lauren Smith), a mum on a Harlesden housing estate who dreams of making it as a reggae star. Forming the all-girl group Neeta, Sweeta and Nastie, with her friends Sharon (Caroline Chikezie) and Yvette (Jocelyn Esien), she puts herself centre stage for the first time in her life. But when family drama comes round the corner, can she keep the spotlight?</p>\n<p>Written by icons of Lovers Rock Carroll Thompson and Beres Hammond, <i>Babymother</i> is a love letter to North West London’s Black community, with plenty of Brent locations to look out for. The film is shot in stunning, warm colour that reflects its affection for its characters. Julian Henriques debut is a delightful, music-dipped treat, whether you’re rewatching or discovering it today.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n<!-- Construkt -->\n    <section class=\"construkt container c-container--padded  u-red-bg \"\n    >\n        <div class=\"c-content-wrap\">\n\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        \n        \n        <div class=\"o-layout o-layout--large\">\n                            <div class=\"o-layout__item u-1/1@desktop\">\n    <div class=\"c-col c-col-text-area\">\n                        <h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">The Kilburn High Road Festival is part of The Kilburn High Road Project, which has been made possible with The National Lottery Heritage Fund with thanks to National Lottery Players. We’re also grateful to Camden Council – Neighbourhood of Culture for their support for the Kilburn High Road Festival.</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-32666 aligncenter\" src=\"https://kiln-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/NLHF_Acknowledgement-stamp_English_White_RGB-300x300.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" srcset=\"https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/NLHF_Acknowledgement-stamp_English_White_RGB.png?resize=300%2C300 300w, https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/NLHF_Acknowledgement-stamp_English_White_RGB.png?resize=1024%2C1024 1024w, https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/NLHF_Acknowledgement-stamp_English_White_RGB.png?resize=150%2C150 150w, https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/NLHF_Acknowledgement-stamp_English_White_RGB.png?resize=768%2C768 768w, https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/NLHF_Acknowledgement-stamp_English_White_RGB.png?resize=1536%2C1536 1536w, https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/NLHF_Acknowledgement-stamp_English_White_RGB.png?resize=320%2C320 320w, https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/NLHF_Acknowledgement-stamp_English_White_RGB.png?resize=640%2C640 640w, https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/NLHF_Acknowledgement-stamp_English_White_RGB.png?resize=960%2C960 960w, https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/NLHF_Acknowledgement-stamp_English_White_RGB.png?w=1667 1667w\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" /></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>The Kilburn High Road Project is supported by The National Lottery Heritage Fund, 29th May 1961 Charitable Trust, The Big Give – Arts for Impact, Camden Council – Neighbourhood of Culture, City Bridge Foundation, John Lyon’s Charity, Jules and Cheryl Burns, The Radcliffe Trust, The Vanderbilt Family Foundation, The Vandervell Foundation, Wembley Stadium Foundation.</strong></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://assets.kilntheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/love-camden-transparent.png?_gl=1*19muxmb*_gcl_aw*R0NMLjE3Nzk0NjUyNDUuQ2owS0NRandfYl9RQmhDU0FSSXNBUDZoUjRmQ2V0ei1aXzJjZzhaTVFJd0JqcW5KLWtuZFB0dUpySXRKcWhzQUtQcngwNlJydmZhZFI3a2FBb3JHRUFMd193Y0I.*_gcl_au*MTk0ODMxNzYwNS4xNzc2NzgwODAwLjE4MDYzNjM3MzQuMTc3OTgwMjg4NC4xNzc5ODAyODg0*_ga*ODExNjEzMjMyLjE3NTMzNjk0NzU.*_ga_BEDS3ME4FP*czE3ODMwODQwNTckbzY5MyRnMSR0MTc4MzA4NDExMiRqNSRsMCRoMA..\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-44335 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.kilntheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/love-camden-transparent-300x169.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" srcset=\"https://assets.kilntheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/love-camden-transparent.png?resize=300%2C169 300w, https://assets.kilntheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/love-camden-transparent.png?resize=1024%2C575 1024w, https://assets.kilntheatre.com/wp-cont