tre.com/your-visit/access/\">Access</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-21931\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-21931\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/how-to-get-here/food-and-drink/\">Food and Drink</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-41535\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-41535\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/\">Our story</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-41539\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-41539\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/jobs/\">Job Opportunities</a></li>\n</ul>            \n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n    <!--[if lte IE 8]>\n<style>\n    body > * {\n        display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    body .no-support {\n        display: block !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<article class=\"no-support\">\n    <h4>Unfortunately the Kiln Theatre website is not accessible via the browser you're currently using.</h4>\n    <p>We recommend <a href=\"http://www.whatbrowser.org/intl/en_uk/\">upgrading your browser</a>.</p>\n</article>\n<![endif]-->\n    <main class=\"global-wrap\">\n<section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--title-bar u-red-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Now Showing</h3>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Masthead -->\n<section class=\"masthead pg__masthead pg__masthead--cinema-image c-box-gradient\" style=\"background-image: url('https://assets.kilntheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/7-1.png?resize=1990%2C796&gravity');\">\n    <div class=\"h-row h-row--film\">\n        <h1 class=\"pg__title\">Blue Heron</h1>\n        <h2>31 Jul&ndash;06 Aug 2026</h2>\n\n                    <ul class=\"h-row__film-info\">\n                                    <li>Directed by Sophy Romvari </li>\n                                    <li>Starring Eylul Guven, Iringó Réti, Ádám Tompa and Edik Beddoes</li>\n                                    <li>91 mins</li>\n                            </ul>\n            </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Book and Trailer Buttons -->\n<section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <ul class=\"c-cinema-book\">\n                            <li><a data-fresco-group=\"trailer\" data-fresco-caption=\"\" class=\"fresco c-btn c-btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6qAK9GwWRe0\">View Trailer</a></li>\n            \n                            <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/blue-heron/#book\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary c-btn--book-film \">\n                        Book Now                    </a>\n                </li>\n                    </ul>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Introduction -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-col-txt\">\n                <p>★★★★★ <em>Financial Times</em><br />\n★★★★ <em>Guardian</em><br />\n★★★★ <em>Time Out</em></p>\n<p>One of the year’s best reviewed films, this piercing debut feature by director Sophy Romvari is a uniquely perceptive view on family life and loss. Sasha (Eylul Guven) and her family arrive in Vancouver Island, hoping to turn a new page. But her half-brother Jeremy (Edik Beddoes) is a chaotic and mercurial presence, intent on spinning family life off its axis once again.</p>\n<p>A deeply felt autobiographical portrait of her ‘90s upbringing, this is heartbreaker but one that anyone with a family will relate to. Like <em>Aftersun</em> before it, <em>Blue Heron</em> circles a child’s past through their present day recollections, miraculously honouring the child’s intense close point of view and the adult’s wider frame.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n<!-- Construkt -->\n\n<!-- Films -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--center-title u-white-bg film-book\" id=\"book\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-film-bookings c-film-bookings--single\">\n                <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Book Now</h3>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Friday 31st July                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/blue-heron/book/879849\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary \">\n                                                    3.30PM\n                                                                                                    </a>\n                                </li>\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Friday 31st July                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/blue-heron/book/880049\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary \">\n                                                    8.15PM\n                                                                                                    </a>\n                                </li>\n                                                    </ul>\n                    </div>\n                             