</div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n    <!--[if lte IE 8]>\n<style>\n    body > * {\n        display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    body .no-support {\n        display: block !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<article class=\"no-support\">\n    <h4>Unfortunately the Kiln Theatre website is not accessible via the browser you're currently using.</h4>\n    <p>We recommend <a href=\"http://www.whatbrowser.org/intl/en_uk/\">upgrading your browser</a>.</p>\n</article>\n<![endif]-->\n    <main class=\"global-wrap\">\n<section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--title-bar u-red-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Now Showing</h3>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Masthead -->\n<section class=\"masthead pg__masthead pg__masthead--cinema-image c-box-gradient\" style=\"background-image: url('https://assets.kilntheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/6-1.png?resize=1990%2C796&gravity');\">\n    <div class=\"h-row h-row--film\">\n        <h1 class=\"pg__title\">A Private Life</h1>\n        <h2>07 Aug&ndash;13 Aug 2026</h2>\n\n                    <ul class=\"h-row__film-info\">\n                                    <li>Directed by Rebecca Zlotowski</li>\n                                    <li>Starring Jodie Foster, Daniel Auteuil, Virginie Efira, Mathieu Amalric and Vincent Lacoste </li>\n                                    <li>108 mins</li>\n                            </ul>\n            </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Book and Trailer Buttons -->\n<section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <ul class=\"c-cinema-book\">\n                            <li><a data-fresco-group=\"trailer\" data-fresco-caption=\"\" class=\"fresco c-btn c-btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2JabG5C6IU8\">View Trailer</a></li>\n            \n                            <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/a-private-life/#book\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary c-btn--book-film \">\n                        Book Now                    </a>\n                </li>\n                    </ul>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Introduction -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-col-txt\">\n                <p>French director Rebecca Zlotowski brings her flair for drama to more charmingly airy material as she pairs with Hollywood royalty Jodie Foster. Foster impressively turns to French for this compellingly zany mystery drama. She plays psychoanalyst Lilian, who is knocked off balance by the suicide of her patient (Virginie Efira, <em>Call My Agent!)</em>. Yet when her ex-husband (Mathieu Almaric) and her daughter (Luàna Bajrami) lead her to suspect foul play&#8230;</p>\n<p><em>A Private Life</em> quickly becomes a cosy crime caper with ripe psychological overtones. Anyone who loved Hitchcock’s psychoanalytic dramas will delight in the unfolding of this mystery.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n<!-- Construkt -->\n\n<!-- Films -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--center-title u-white-bg film-book\" id=\"book\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-film-bookings c-film-bookings--single\">\n                <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Book Now</h3>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Friday 7th August                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                   