08\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-608\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/give/\">Give</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1946\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1946\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/creative-engagement/\">Creative Engagement</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-35321\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-35321\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/hire/\">Hires</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-23505\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-23505\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/kiln-card/\">Kiln Card</a></li>\n</ul>            \n                            <ul id=\"menu-main-menu-secondary-nav\" class=\"o-nav global-header__nav global-header__nav--secondary\"><li id=\"menu-item-21712\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-21712\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/your-visit/\">Your Visit</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-14318\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-14318\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/your-visit/access/\">Access</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-21931\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-21931\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/how-to-get-here/food-and-drink/\">Food and Drink</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-41535\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-41535\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/\">Our story</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-41539\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-41539\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/jobs/\">Job Opportunities</a></li>\n</ul>            \n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n    <!--[if lte IE 8]>\n<style>\n    body > * {\n        display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    body .no-support {\n        display: block !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<article class=\"no-support\">\n    <h4>Unfortunately the Kiln Theatre website is not accessible via the browser you're currently using.</h4>\n    <p>We recommend <a href=\"http://www.whatbrowser.org/intl/en_uk/\">upgrading your browser</a>.</p>\n</article>\n<![endif]-->\n    <main class=\"global-wrap\">\n<section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--title-bar u-red-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Now Showing</h3>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Masthead -->\n<section class=\"masthead pg__masthead pg__masthead--cinema-image c-box-gradient\" style=\"background-image: url('https://assets.kilntheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Ish-header.png?resize=1990%2C796&gravity');\">\n    <div class=\"h-row h-row--film\">\n        <h1 class=\"pg__title\">Ish + Q&A</h1>\n        <h2>12 Aug&ndash;19 Aug 2026</h2>\n\n                    <ul class=\"h-row__film-info\">\n                                    <li>Directed by Imran Perretta</li>\n                                    <li>Starring Farhan Hasnat, Yahya Kitana, Avin Shah, Sudha Bhuchar and Joy Crookes</li>\n                                    <li>89 mins</li>\n                            </ul>\n            </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Book and Trailer Buttons -->\n<section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <ul class=\"c-cinema-book\">\n                            <li><a data-fresco-group=\"trailer\" data-fresco-caption=\"\" class=\"fresco c-btn c-btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fWvNcjOGTtM\">View Trailer</a></li>\n            \n                            <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/ish/#book\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary c-btn--book-film \">\n                        Book Now                    </a>\n                </li>\n                    </ul>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Introduction -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-col-txt\">\n                <p><strong>We are proud to welcome director Imran Perretta, producer Dhiraj Mahey and co-writer Enda Walsh for a Q&amp;A following the screening</strong>.</p>\n<p>&#8220;A complex, compassionate drama&#8221; ★★★★ <em>The Guardian</em></p>\n<p>Ish (Farhan Hasnat) and Maram (Yahya Kitani) are life-long friends, even if they&#8217;re only twelve. It&#8217;s a long summer in their hometown Luton, and the streets are calling. They play somewhere between childish games and adult danger, but when Maram is dragged into a traumatic stop and search he pulls away from his friend. Can they find their way back to each other?</p>\n<p>One of the year&#8217;s best debuts, <em>Ish </em>is the rare film that moves beyond stereotypes and well-worn focuses to find a different, deeper story about modern Britain. Intimately linked with its setting in Luton, this is nonetheless a portrait of our country that is compellingly recognisable anywhere. It&#8217;s deftly drawn – not least because of its stunning black and white cinematography – and sharply scripted. Co-written by playwright and screenwriter Enda Walsh (<em>Small Things Like These, Hunger</em>) it marks director Imran Peretta out as a talent to watch.</p>\n<p>Programmed in collaboration with <a href=\"https://filmscope.org/\">Filmscope CIC</a>.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n<!-- Construkt -->\n\n<!-- Films -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--center-title u-white-bg film-book\" id=\"book\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-film-bookings c-film-bookings--single\">\n                <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Book Now</h3>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Wednesday 12th August                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/ish/book/862449\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary \">\n                                                    8.00PM\n                                                                                                    </a>\n                                </li>\n                                                    </ul>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Friday 14th August                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/ish/book/883049\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary \">\n                                                    6.10PM\n                                                                                                    </a>\n                                </li>\n                                                    </ul>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                                       